{"articleNo":"151475","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=151475&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[K-RC교육원] 2016-상반기 오름관1동 만족도조사 실시","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.05.23","hit":"2367","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2016-상반기 오름관1동 만족도 조사를 아래와 같이 실시합니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">본 조사는 사업자가 제공하는 서비스 분야에 대한 관생들의 의견을 수렴하여</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">운영 실태를 개선하는 한편, 만족도조사를 반영한 성과평가 결과에 따라</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">사업자에게 서비스대가를 차등 지급하게 됩니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">오름관1동 운영에 대한 올바른 성과평가를 위해 관생 여러분의 설문조사 참여를</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">당부드리니 2016-1학기 오름관1동 입사자는 모두</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 협조해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#050099\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">▶ 오름관1동 만족도 조사 ◀</span></font></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">■ 대상</span></span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">2016-1학기 오름관1동 입사자 전체</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">■ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">기간</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#ef000b\">2016. 5. 23(월) ~ 6. 12(일)</font></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">■ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">방법</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">온라인 조사(K-RC교육원 홈페이지 팝업)</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><u></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><u></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><u></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><u></u>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><u></u>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><u></u>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><u></u>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: